      "body": "### Project URL\n\nhttps://github.com/mokshablr/gander\n\n### Category\n\nKotlin\n\n### Project Title\n\nAndroid file viewer that needs no permissions\n\n### Project Description\n\nGander opens PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, photos, video, audio, Markdown, code and STL files on Android, and shows what is inside a .zip. It asks for no permissions and has no internet access. No ads, no trackers, no account. MIT licensed.\n\n### Highlights\n\nIt opens the files you hand it, through the file picker, Open with, or a folder you grant once, and never asks for storage permission. A Gradle check fails the build if a library slips a new permission into the manifest. About 5 MB, one build for every phone, Android 8.0 and newer.\n\n### Example Code\n\n_No response_\n\n### Screenshots or Demo Videos\n\n![Gander demo: recent files, a granted folder, then PDF, Word, Excel and Markdown files opening](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mokshablr/gander/main/docs/demo.gif)\n\n\n",
