      "body": "### Project URL\n\nhttps://github.com/egmalt/house-planner\n\n### Category\n\nJS\n\n### Project Title\n\nHouse planner: 2D plan, 3D, utility networks\n\n### Project Description\n\nA self-hosted planner for a private house: draw a true-scale 2D floor plan, see it in 3D and on satellite imagery, lay out sewer, electrical, water and underfloor heating with checks, and get a priced bill of materials. React + PHP, no database.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- The plan is one JSON document in millimetres with a zod schema, so it can be edited by hand, by scripts or by an LLM assistant and pushed back through a versioned API (If-Match / 409).\n- Engineering checks beyond drawing: sewer slopes and invert levels, circuits with breakers, RCDs and voltage drop, automatic underfloor heating loop layout.\n- 3D with three.js / React Three Fiber, openings cut with three-bvh-csg; runs on any PHP 8.1 shared hosting or via docker compose.\n- MIT. Interface in English and Russian. Live demo without login (resets hourly): https://app.homedesignsai.pro\n- Disclosure: I'm the author (team behind homedesignsai.pro).\n\n### Example Code\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/egmalt/house-planner.git\ncd house-planner\ndocker compose up -d --build\n```\n\n### Screenshots or Demo Videos\n\n![3D view](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/egmalt/house-planner/main/docs/screenshots/hero.png)\n![2D plan](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/egmalt/house-planner/main/docs/screenshots/plan.png)\n",
